  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvt49e63e9k33qqkxemn4j417@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1920\" data-video-height=\"1080\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvt49e63e9k33qqkxemn4j417/thumbs/4.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33300392386&amp;signature=zWuFMZLn1%2B8J8VY11bpSL4p%2FRfQ%3D&amp;ts=1743483586\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1920\" data-video-origin-height=\"1080\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvt49e63e9k33qqkxemn4j417?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2dDQ5ZTYzZTlrMzNxcWt4ZW1uNGo0MTciLCJ0aWQiOiJhNWNkNTM4Zi1lNGVmLTQ4YTItODYzMC1mZDVlNDUyMDA1NTMiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODczOTh9.1LX35I_-1dwJPcjbD8nfQEJfy2bvN4fftDWumh20uKvQj2Y_Gd5zU5pUbziNX2NnIfAigkTlvjeriKVpDPLmRA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">먼저 모르핀과 아세트산을 준비합니다. </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b6db17d08b95c30f936df242910ff43f43c3206a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b6db17d08b95c30f936df242910ff43f43c3206a\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1048\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이게 모르핀입니다.<br><br>모르핀의 산소 원자 두 곳에 수소 대신 아세틸을 붙여줍니다. 그러면 혈뇌관장벽을 훨씬 잘 뚫는</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c4d2fc6665f627abdb6ea9895c90f20ea5e8b46\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c4d2fc6665f627abdb6ea9895c90f20ea5e8b46\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1048\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">최강의 마약인 헤로인이 만들어집니다.<br><br>모르핀의 acetylation 과정을 분자 모형으로 표현해봤네요. 물론 실제로 합성할때는 아세트산무수물(Ac₂O)을 쓰지만 그냥 아세트산이 더 친숙해서 저렇게 해 보았습니다.<br><br>분자 모형갖고 이런거 해보는것도 재미있네요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f13b523f53cf9cca4afecb37f3a5d657f35ac2b4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f13b523f53cf9cca4afecb37f3a5d657f35ac2b4\" data-origin-width=\"168\" data-origin-height=\"223\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">암튼 제목 어그로는 정말 죄송합니다. 기대하신 분들 있을까봐...</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
